+// `studioSnapshotDigestInputV1` / `canonicalStudioSnapshotDigestInputV1` (studio-snapshot.ts): the same
+// recursively-key-sorted-canonical-JSON sha256 recipe as `PortfolioDigest`, over a different field set.
