+    {
+      "ruleId": "rule.scope.protected-surfaces",
+      "statement": "Normal implementation tasks may not modify policy locks, approval rules, CI workflows, test harnesses, visual baselines, gate thresholds, signing material, or release logic. Changes to a protected surface require a separately classified task and the surface's change-approval action, and quality gates, baselines, or acceptance criteria are never weakened to make a task pass.",
