+      "ruleId": "rule.security.no-credentials-in-artifacts",
+      "statement": "Credentials, tokens, private keys, and provisioning material never appear in prompts, logs, fixtures, artifacts, issues, commits, or screenshots, and never ship in client code. Secret-shaped material in a change is refused before commit.",
