+      "statement": "A new project confirms the user outcome, MVP boundary, platforms, persistence, backend policy, privacy constraints, and monetization assumptions, establishes architecture and feature contracts, reviews the reusable-library catalog before implementing networking, persistence, StoreKit, export, logging, accessibility helpers, permissions, notifications, or test infrastructure, and implements one vertical feature slice with real behavior and tests before expanding breadth.",
