+# Portfolio
+
+Provider-neutral multi-project read model and deterministic work scheduler. It
+combines project, delivery, quality, release, and analytics observations without
+inventing missing metrics or allowing one provider to become authoritative for
+Factory state.
+
+Scheduling produces a proposal of conflict-free waves. It does not launch work;
+the durable kernel still claims every task and resource independently.
